DATA SOURCES (3) - each bound through DBHealthPageViewModel into one StateFlow<UiState<DBHealthData>> (P1/S8):
  useConnectionPool  GET /dev-tools/runtime-info       -> AdminStore.connectionPool()  (sidebar pool panel)
  useDBStats         GET /dev-tools/db-stats           -> AdminStore.dbStats()         (phase spine: cards/chart/table)
  useMigrations      GET /dev-tools/migration-status   -> AdminStore.migrations()      (sidebar migration panel)
  db-stats is the page-phase spine; migrations + connection-pool fold in best-effort, each carrying its own
  loading/empty/error sub-state (SourcePhase) so a still-loading or failed sidebar read never blanks the page.
  Raw verbatim server JSON parsed off-device in DBHealthPageModel.kt (snake_case, tolerant of camelCase aliases);
  values are byte counts / row counts / a migration version / pool gauges - none unit-bearing, so no SI conversion
  (S5); byte + locale-number formatting applied at the render boundary.

