=== SUMMARY ===
data sources : DBHealthPageViewModel combines 3 shared S8 cache-then-network feeds
               (AdminStore.dbStats / migrations / connectionPool) into StateFlow<UiState<DBHealthData>>;
               /dev-tools/db-stats is the phase spine, migrations + connection-pool fold in best-effort with their
               own SourcePhase (loading/empty/error/content); no HTTP in the view (DBHealthPageSource seam).
nav          : Destinations 'dbHealth' -> /db-health (pre-existing row) wired to DBHealthRoute() via
               PageHosts.register; deep link auto-registered by TeslaSyncNavHost. TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate ->
               DBHealthPageHost.register().
panels       : 8/8 - 4 StatCards (Total-DB-Size/Tables/Large-Tables/Migration-Version), Table-Sizes-Top-15
               ChartContainer+BarChart, GlassPanel6 sortable Tables DataTable (size/rows/name sort buttons,
               5 columns), GlassPanel7 Migration-Status, GlassPanel8 Connection-Pool (6 gauges + usage MetricBar).
charts       : ChartContainer chrome + BarChartWrapper (A3 Vico-native, ChartSeriesKind.Bar) - no webview clone.
states       : loading / empty / error / success via UiPhase dispatch in DBHealthPageContent; additionally each of
               the 3 data sources renders its own loading (Skeleton) / empty (EmptyState) / error (PanelInlineError)
               / content sub-state - no region ever blank (ADR-011).
i18n         : all 41 visible dbHealth.* strings resolve from res/values/strings.xml translation_dbHealth_* keys
               (38 pre-existing reused, 3 added: chartTitle.aria/noMigrationData/noPoolData across values/-ar/-he);
               the Retry affordance reuses the catalog's translation_queryError_retry; zero hardcoded literals.
units        : none unit-bearing (bytes/counts/version/pool gauges) - no SI conversion; byte + locale formatting at
               the render boundary (formatBytes mirrors web; NumberFormat integer instance).
a11y         : page heading semantics, ChartContainer accessibleDescription + expandable data-table fallback,
               Material 3 dynamic/dark theme + >=48dp targets via shared components.
